      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Between 1568 and 1575 Emperor Maximilian II built the Neugebäude palace with gardens, a zoo, and fortified walls between Simmering and Kaiserebersdorf; the zoo survived until 1752.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
