      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 19th century Simmering generated electricity for Vienna’s trams and operated a gas works that supplied town gas to the city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simmering_(Vienna)",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Feuerhalle Simmering, Vienna’s first crematorium, opened between 1921 and 1923 as an Expressionist landmark designed by Clemens Holzmeister.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
